# Single notes from the bottom to the top of the range (C1 .. C7) with glides between ringing strings, a bend, and
# notes outside the range (folded by octaves). Sine input, so a click would stand out.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 1
track fx1
input sine 196 0.6
param p1 200
param p2 70
param pan 220
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 C1 4
note 4 G2 4
note 8 C3 4
note 12 E4 4
note 16 C6 4
note 20 C7 4
note 24 A3 8
bend 26 200
bend 30 -200
bend 32 0
note 32 F0 4
note 36 C9 4
note 40 D3 8
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
